      "comment": "FEDERAL ARLO (7) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing sixth (22.64) at this track in a Grade 5. Looks suited here and big improvement expected. TELEPORTER (1) failed to come into contention last start at this track, but prior to that won easily by 6 lengths at this track (21.86) beating Fly Like Potter in a Grade 6 on August 11. Has ability and can measure up. POPULAR MONSTER (4) turned in a moderate effort last time when fifth at this track over 380m behind Thunderlash (22.41) in a P5. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. ZERO FORGING (3) must be included in main hopes on latest effort.",
